   "id": "Auto_generate_Bin_file_frm_custm_chart",
   "name": "Auto generate Bin file frm custm chart",
   "type": "Indicator",
   "stage": "DEV",
   "parent": "Auto_detect_amount_of_BARS",
   "project": "TopDog_-_Cherry_Picking",
   "desc": "You now do one thing: attach the indicator to the real GBPUSD chart and enter both From and To (2015-01-01 and 2016-12-31).\nIf the range is far back, with at least 2000 bars newer than your To date and more than 5000 bars needed, it does the rest itself:\nIt saves the chart as a temporary template.\nIt closes any old GBPUSD_W window chart.\nIt builds the small window chart with your range plus warm-up bars.\nIt opens that chart and attaches itself there with the same dates.\nThe .bin file is produced on the window chart, under the real symbol name GBPUSD.\nThe real chart only shows a note saying where the work is happening. The new chart shows the stage-by-stage progress.\nRanges that reach up to the present, or where only one date is given, are calculated directly on the real chart as before.",
